PRIVACY POLICY FOR HEXMERGE: AGES OF CIVILIZATION
Last Updated: March 30, 2026

This Privacy Policy explains how HexMerge: Ages of Civilization ("we," "us," or "our") collects, uses, and discloses information about you when you use our mobile application on iOS.

1. Information We Collect
To provide a progressive gameplay experience through different ages and track your achievements, we collect limited data.

a. Gameplay & Civilization Progress: * Purpose: To save your current civilization (e.g., Stone Age), discovered items (e.g., Spear, Cave Art), board state, and high scores.

Processing: This data is stored locally on your device or via Apple's iCloud/Game Center to ensure you don't lose progress.

b. In-App Purchases (IAP): * Purpose: To manage "Gold" balances and "Upgrade" transactions.

Processing: All financial transactions are handled securely by Apple App Store. We do not collect or store your credit card or bank details. We only receive confirmation from Apple when a purchase is successful.

c. Usage Data & Diagnostics:

Purpose: To improve game stability and fix bugs related to the hexagonal merging mechanics.

Processing: This data is anonymous and aggregated.

2. Advertising & Third-Party Services
To keep the game free to play and provide "Earn Gold" features, we use third-party advertising networks (e.g., Google AdMob).

a. Rewarded Ads: If you choose to "watch to earn" gold, the ad network will process your interaction to verify the reward.

b. Identifiers (IDFA): With your permission via the App Tracking Transparency (ATT) prompt, we may use your device’s Advertising Identifier to show relevant ads.

c. Your Choice: You can opt-out of tracking by selecting "Ask App Not to Track." The game features, including the ability to earn gold via ads, will still function, but ads will not be personalized.

3. Data Sharing and Disclosure
We do not sell your personal data. We share anonymous, aggregated data with third-party service providers solely for:

Displaying advertisements.

Analyzing app performance.

Processing in-app purchases through Apple.

4. Children’s Privacy
HexMerge: Ages of Civilization is intended for a general audience. We do not knowingly collect personal data from children under the age of 13. If you believe we have inadvertently collected such data, please contact us for immediate deletion.

5. Security
We take reasonable measures to protect your information. Most game data remains on your device. We recommend keeping your device OS updated for the best security.

6. Changes to This Privacy Policy
We may update this policy to reflect new game features or legal requirements. We will notify you by revising the "Last Updated" date at the top of this policy.

